<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz April unemployment falls to 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz April unemployment falls to 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Kyrgyzstan totalled 67,000, or 7.1 percent of the workforce at the end of April, compared to 71,000, or 7.4 percent, in March, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	 Apr 97   Mar 97   Apr 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed	   67,000   71,000   77,000</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce    7.1	7.4	4.1</p>
<p>NOTE -- Unemployment figures for March and April this year have been adjusted to the methodology used by the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
